0..75 Comment "// Abandoning the rest of a scope ends what it held without resuming it: an"
76..154 Comment "// access abandoned before its `resume` writes nothing back, so its hold keeps"
155..231 Comment "// the value it held. A handler clause that does not resume its continuation"
232..298 Comment "// discards it (Plotkin and Pretnar, _Handling Algebraic Effects_,"
299..332 Comment "// doi:10.2168/LMCS-9(4:23)2013)."
334..365 Comment "// Early exit\'s host interface."
